<view class="page"><view class="row between"><view class="eyebrow">城知 · HEFEI CITY GUIDE</view><view class="meta">{{weather}}</view></view><view class="hero real-hero"><image class="hero-photo" src="{{hero.miniUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="hero-wash"/><view class="hero-words"><view class="eyebrow">公开资料，连接真实生活</view><view class="h1">在合肥，<view class="accent">把日子过明白。</view></view><view class="sub">住房、工作、教育、医疗与文化。<view>把分散信息，整理成有关的答案。</view></view></view><view class="photo-credit">{{hero.caption}} · {{hero.date}}<view>© {{hero.author}} · {{hero.license}}</view></view></view><view class="search"><input placeholder="例如：租房备案和孩子入学有什么关系？" value="{{q}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search"/><button bindtap="search">搜索 →</button></view><view class="meta">{{boot.research.localDocuments}} 篇本地正文 · {{boot.research.nationalDocuments}} 篇全国资料 · {{boot.research.categories}} 个领域 · {{boot.research.syntheses}} 个融合专题</view><view class="h2">先找到，正在面对的事</view><view class="grid"><button wx:for="{{domains}}" wx:key="id" class="entry" data-category="{{item.id}}" bindtap="theme"><view class="title">{{item.title}} ↗</view><view class="meta">{{item.sub}}</view></button></view><view class="h2">一个问题，放在一起看</view><view wx:for="{{boot.scenarios}}" wx:key="id" class="card scenario-native" data-id="{{item.articleId}}" bindtap="article"><image class="scenario-image" src="{{item.photo.miniUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="meta">主题配图：{{item.photo.caption}} · {{item.photo.date}}</view><view class="meta">© {{item.photo.author}} · {{item.photo.license}}</view><view class="meta">跨资料融合 · {{item.sourceCount}} 份原文</view><view class="title">{{item.title}} ↗</view><view class="body">{{item.description}}</view></view><view class="h2">读过正文，再整理给你</view><view wx:for="{{articles}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="article"><view class="meta">{{item.source.publisher}} · {{item.publishedAt||'原文日期未记录'}}</view><view class="title">{{item.title}} ↗</view><view class="body">{{item.preview}}</view><view class="scope-note">{{item.scope}}</view></view><view class="grid"><button class="primary" data-page="ask" bindtap="go">问问合肥</button><button class="secondary" data-page="life" bindtap="go">生活清单</button><button class="secondary" data-page="explore" bindtap="go">城市地图</button><button class="secondary" data-page="plan" bindtap="go">游览行程</button></view><button class="link" data-page="sources" bindtap="go">查看正文来源、实景照片与许可 →</button><view class="notice">精选公开资料仍在扩充。照片是真实拍摄的历史影像，不表示实时状态；原文年度、对象和现行办理规则须分别核对。</view><view class="footer">城知 · 把合肥，慢慢读懂。</view></view>